  "description": "Standalone observer nodes for FluxFlow (counter, logger, metrics) built on the FluxFlow.Nodes kit: an input in, a snapshot or log entry broadcast out — all carrying the message correlation id. No engine required.",
  "id": "FluxFlow.Components.Observability",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-19T12:53:24.66Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
