  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 46175,
  "published": "2026-06-19T12:50:46.9Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt the counter, logger, and metrics nodes as standalone FlowNode<TInput, TOutput> processors over the FluxFlow.Nodes kit: input in, a FlowCounterSnapshot / FlowLogEntry / FlowMetricSnapshot broadcast out, failures on the error port and diagnostics on the events port — all carrying the message correlation id. The engine factory, module, registration extensions, design-metadata provider, component-type/port constants, the definition-options reader, and the type/selector/expression-engine/context-factory resolution layer are removed; each node takes its options record (and, for the counter, an IFlowExpressionEngine and optional IFlowMapContextFactory from FluxFlow.Mapping) plus an optional TimeProvider directly, and depends only on FluxFlow.Nodes and FluxFlow.Mapping (runs without the engine).",
